{"createdAt":1785081602121,"expiresAt":1785168002121,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=2352670&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"2352670":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Arcadium - Space Odyssey","steam_appid":2352670,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Harvest Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the calm moments between alien waves to land on planets, gather vital resources, and prepare for the next fight.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.poster.avif?t=1781123201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.webm?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.mp4?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run generates a brand-new universe filled with unique planets, wandering merchants, cosmic anomalies, and unexpected discoveries as you travel through space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/673e72cb30ac6bf88138b35b72a8a57f.poster.avif?t=1781123201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/673e72cb30ac6bf88138b35b72a8a57f.webm?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/673e72cb30ac6bf88138b35b72a8a57f.mp4?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Tight movement, smart skill use, and solid preparation are essential as enemies grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.poster.avif?t=1781123201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.webm?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.mp4?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build your way to victory </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spaceship and combine artifacts, talents, items and relics to forge unique builds. Experiment with countless synergies and unleash your own playstyle in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.poster.avif?t=1781123201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.webm?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.mp4?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.poster.avif?t=1781123201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.webm?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.mp4?t=1781123201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: A procedurally generated universe that offers limitless exploration with planets, stars and cosmic wonders, setting it apart from traditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts, and relics, that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong> Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong> Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>And more: </strong>Missions, unlockables, secrets, and surprises await. </p></li></ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Harvest Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the calm moments between alien waves to land on planets, gather vital resources, and prepare for the next fight.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.poster