ditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts, and relics, that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong> Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong> Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>And more: </strong>Missions, unlockables, secrets, and surprises await. </p></li></ul>","short_description":"A bullet heaven roguelite set in a procedurally generated universe. Land on planets to harvest resources, craft hundreds of game-breaking builds, and unleash them on relentless waves of aliens. Every run unveils a new universe: endless challenges, endless discoveries.","supported_languages":"English, Italian, French, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, German, Polish, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/32764cb8d5112fb366cc49e7ff2823899a509e2c/header.jpg?t=1781123201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/8500579191ee1678b9b6d0a1f7630592d15b002a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781123201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/8500579191ee1678b9b6d0a1f7630592d15b002a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781123201","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 950 or similar<br>